<title>SPAIN: Mapfre Vida '96 net profit rose 7.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Mapfre Vida '96 net profit rose 7.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mapfre Vida 1996 consolidated results (in billions of pesetas, unless stated):</p>
<p> Pretax profit			     8.06   vs    6.65</p>
<p> Net profit after minorities, taxes  5.75   vs    5.12</p>
<p> Net premiums			     85.64   vs   77.87</p>
<p>NOTE - Mapfre Vida SA, Spain's leading life insurer, said the funds managed by Mapfre Inversion grew by 46 percent to 188.17 billion pesetas and the funds managed by Mapfre Vida Pensiones rose by 66 percent to 27.54 billion.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2151</p>
</text>
